---
source: xtask/src/help.rs
expression: help_for(&path)
---
The release pipeline's steps (docs/releasing.md)

Usage: cargo xtask release <COMMAND>

Commands:
  prepare           Bump the version and write the changelog section (RELEASE_DATE gives the date)
  check-tag         Check that a tag names the workspace version
  notes             Print a version's release notes from CHANGELOG.md
  checksums         Write SHA256SUMS for every file in a directory
  verify-checksums  Check every file in a directory against its SHA256SUMS
  provenance        The provenance hook (does nothing until RELEASE_PROVENANCE is on)
  verify            Verify every signature in a directory, including inside packages
  help              Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
